The dLAN pro 500 Wireless plus (also spelled "dLAN 500 wireless+") is a device with:
  * WiFi (compatible with the ath9k driver)
  * An ethernet interface with a 3 ethernet ports switch (The switch can be configured with "swconfig")
  * A [[wp>Power-line_communication|Powerline]] network interface
  * 128MB of RAM
  * About 7.5MB of usable flash space for OpenWrt

